That hasn't been my experience.  As I've posted just recently, I did a test 
of all the weapons a while back.  With a +5 weapon I found FrostBrand to 
have better killing power.  I tested this by becoming a Marilith (a type 
of demon) who gets 3 attacks per round.  Hasted (with speed boots) it 
doubles it.  When going up against the wizard, I could kill him faster
with a FrostBrand than Mjollnir.

Now if you are up against a frost resistant creature, it doesn't work as 
well.  But then again, the same is true of Mojo and shock resistant 
creatures.  Both are rare in the game.

